<title>USA: Northern sees Minn. coal unit back Monday.</title>
<headline>Northern sees Minn. coal unit back Monday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern States Power Co's 222 megawatt Riverside 8 coal-fired power plant, shut Friday for maintenance, is expected to return to service later today, the company said Monday.</p>
<p>The unit is located in Minneapolis, Minn.</p>
<p>((--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
</text>
